Referenced projects (ideas and system-call facts; no source files are included):
- ColorGoogle (joeyandu), GPL-3.0 — https://github.com/joeyandu/ColorGoogle
  ColorOS native bar long-press trigger idea.
- MiCTS (parallelcc), GPL-3.0 — https://github.com/parallelcc/MiCTS (checked version 2.6)
  Circle to Search is opened through the "voiceinteraction" system service (IVoiceInteractionManagerService
  showSessionFromSession) with an "omni.entry_point" argument. This app makes that call itself (CtsSession.java).
- MindTrigger Assist (evokermc098-coder), GPL-3.0 — https://github.com/evokermc098-coder/MindTriggerAssist
  The app's own logd connection and the focus bridge approach.

